+    /// to 0 every `reset_min`..`reset_max` samples (per series).
+    Counter { rate: f64, reset_fraction: f64, reset_min: u64, reset_max: u64 },
+    /// Zipf gauge (2026-11-21): a Zipf(s) draw over 1..=n times the series'
+    /// scale, rounded to `decimals`.
+    /// `integer` (default): k · max(1, round(scale)), an integer (Zipf data as
